el, so downstream selection can retain each authored occurrence.\n\n## Changes\n\nThe source reader records explicit selections separately from presentation context.\n\n### Source Occurrences\n\n- **Expose title tags.**\n  Inline and resolved reference-style links carry an immutable complete-name set read by the shared preset-list reader.\n- **Keep source context separate.**\n  Containing headings, labels and title tags occupy distinct fields through every source region.\n- **Exclude resource and diagram text.**\n  Image titles, external-link titles and Mermaid tooltips or labels supply no named selection.\n\n### Observing Checks\n\n- **Exercise parser and publication boundaries.**\n  Source tests cover decoded attributes and occurrence contexts; resource and Mermaid corpus fixtures verify preserved publication and implicit default selection.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Source and shared-reader tests covering parsed title occurrences and resource exclusion | AC4, AC5 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w02-source-links-carry-title/validation.md#source-reader-checks) |\n| T2 | Resource and diagram publication corpus fixtures in configured make check | AC5 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w02-source-links-carry-title/validation.md#resource-and-diagram-corpus) |\n| T3 | Full deterministic repository check | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w02-source-links-carry-title/validation.md#full-deterministic-check) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Validation record](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/tree/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w02-source-links-carry-title) — tested revisions, observing checks and review findings.\n- **R2.** [Preset-selection contract](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/c67cf78f020923c4e5bd25d95497ced206be7161/artifacts/planning/2026-10-17-prosiform-v1/design.md#presets) — title-list interpretation, source contexts and resource boundaries.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-06T10:56:58Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T11:00:13Z","closed_at":"2026-11-06T11:00:12Z","merged_at":"2026-11-06T11:00:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"227069a8fed00554deb7f044da37f396f35a3208","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"m2ux:i10/e07/w02-source-links-carry-title","ref":"i10/e07/w02-source-links-carry-title","repo":{"id":1423224592,"node_id":"R_kgDOVNSvEA","name":"prosiform","full_name":"m2ux/prosiform","owner":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"A deterministic compiler for instruction sets written as linked Markdown. Give it a document or a section; it returns that content and every local Markdown dependency it reaches, as one validated bundle.","homepage":"","language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,